"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_OldDisembark_TT";"显示是否启用了旧式的、不太安全的下船方式."
"_MIRAGE_UI_MirageServer_AuraSharing";"光环共享"
"_MIRAGE_UI_MirageServer_AuraSharing_TT";"允许盟友玩家互相受益于彼此的光环."
