"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_NoHumpWalking_TT";"显示单位是否会跛行."
"_MIRAGE_NT_MeteorAttack";"玩家 %1 准备发动流星攻击"
"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_RemoveTitans";"禁用泰坦:"
