"_MIRAGE_UI_MirageServer_DeliveryUnbound";"无限制交付"
"_MIRAGE_UI_MirageServer_DeliveryUnbound_TT";"如果选择, 即使期间单位上限降低, 新单位的生产也会完成."
"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_DeliveryUnbound_TT";"显示即使期间人口上限降低, 单位生产是否仍能完成."
"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_DisableArtifactRelease";"禁止放下:"
