"_MIRAGE_CDKEYHASH_CONFLICT";"你无法继续, 因为你使用的序列号与以下玩家相同: "
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER";"丛林狂热 (1对4)"
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER_DESC";"北方资源丰富的高原一直是兵家必争之地. 四名挑战者试图击败现在的主人. 谁会在这场争夺丛林王座的狂热之战中胜出?"
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER_DEF";"丛林狂热 (1对4 守卫)"
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER_DEF_DESC";"北方资源丰富的高原一直是兵家必争之地. 四名挑战者试图击败现在的主人. 谁会在这场争夺丛林王座的狂热之战中胜出?"
"_MN_MP_4_DEATH_VALLEY";"死亡之谷"
"_MN_MP_4_DEATH_VALLEY_DESC";"四个部落试图统治这座山谷, 但这场冲突只给所有人带来死亡和毁灭."
"_MN_MP_8_WATERDOMINATION";"海上统治"
"_MN_MP_8_WATERDOMINATION_DESC";"两座岛上的居民无休止地战斗, 以统治周围的海洋并找到散落各处的宝藏. 屠杀结束时, 谁的鲜血会把海水染红?"
"_MN_MP_7_JUNGLEFEVER_DEF";"丛林狂热 (2对4 守卫)"
"_MN_MP_7_JUNGLEFEVER_DEF_DESC";"北方资源丰富的高原一直是兵家必争之地. 四名挑战者试图击败现在的主人们. 谁会在这场争夺丛林王座的狂热之战中胜出?"
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER_DOM";"丛林狂热 (1对4 守卫-统治)"
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER_DOM_DESC";"The resource-rich plateau in the north has always been fiercely fought over. Four contenders try to overcome the current owner. Who will succeed in this feverish line for the jungle throne? Mode Defender - domination! Hq 1 - the defender must hold the flag for 60 minutes. Hq 2, 3 is team 1 and hq 4, 5 team 2. One of the teams must capture the flag and hold it for 12 minutes."
"_MN_MP_6_JUNGLEFEVER_DOOM_DESC";"The resource-rich plateau in the north has always been fiercely fought over. Four contenders try to overcome the current owner. Who will succeed in this feverish line for the jungle throne? Mode Defender - domination! Hq 1 - the defender must hold the flag for 60 minutes. Hq 2, 3 is team 1 and hq 4, 5 team 2. One of the teams must capture the flag and hold it for 12 minutes."
"_MN_MP_8_ANGKORWAT";"吴哥窟"
"_MN_MP_8_ANGKORWAT_DESC";"热情的寻宝者们不惜一切代价, 要找到隐藏在丛林深处的神庙之城及其无数宝藏. 但只有一个人能把它们带回家. 那会是谁呢?"
"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_DominationContinue";"持续统治:"
"_MIRAGE_UI_MirageServer_DominationContinue";"持续统治"
"_MIRAGE_UI_MirageServer_DominationContinue_TT";"在统治模式中, 即使一支队伍失去了之前占领的所有旗帜, 计时器也不会重置."
"_MIRAGE_UI_OverView_Label_DominationContinue_TT";"在统治模式中, 即使一支队伍失去了之前占领的所有旗帜, 计时器也不会重置."
